WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.438
The evaluation uses two standard citation graphs,
Cora-ML and Citeseer,

00:00:04.518 --> 00:00:08.575
with a few thousand nodes each, and two
representative backbones,

00:00:08.655 --> 00:00:12.265
a graph convolution network and a graph attention network.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:17.611
The attacker's budget is swept from twenty up to a
hundred and sixty injected nodes,

00:00:17.691 --> 00:00:21.684
with the per-node edge limit set to each graph's
average degree.

00:00:21.764 --> 00:00:29.002
The smoothed classifier is estimated with a hundred
thousand Monte Carlo samples at a one percent confidence level,

00:00:29.082 --> 00:00:33.520
and every linear program is solved with the MOSEK
solver through CVXPY.
